				<wikidot:authorName>Francis Willjam</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1394675</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I think I might refrain from voting on -J's or lolfoundation articles in the near future because I think the fact that I've found the last 10 or so not even remotely funny might be a fault with me and not with the articles.</p> <p>That being said, the humour recently has been so formulaic, it's either &quot;a normal thing dressed up with SCP-lingo&quot; or &quot;something stupidly childish dressed up with foundation lingo&quot; or &quot;a site trope dressed up in foundation lingo.&quot;</p> 
				 	]]>
